# Normalize every text file to LF, in the repository and in the working tree.
# Without this, a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true rewrites files to CRLF,
# which changes the bytes npm packs (0.1.3 drifted by 17 bytes exactly this way):
# the tarball hash only reproduced after `git -c core.autocrlf=false checkout`.
* text=auto eol=lf
